flowchart TD
  A[Human / System Authority] --> B[Source]
  B --> C[Intent / Command]
  C --> D[Transaction + Mutation Set]
  D --> E[BKH-2 Validation]
  E --> F[Authorization Gate]
  F --> G[CanonicalProjectRepository]
  G --> H{One IndexedDB readwrite transaction}
  H --> I[Canonical Revision]
  H --> J[Transaction Result]
  H --> K[Idempotency Record]
  H --> L[Commit Metadata]
  H --> M[Audit / Provenance]
  I --> N[Read Models / Rebuildable Projections]
  N --> O[ProjectContext as Working Projection]
  O --> P[UI / Viewers / Analytics]
  G -. stale expectedRevision .-> Q[STALE_TRANSACTION / CONFLICT]
  G -. repeated transactionId .-> R[ALREADY_COMMITTED]
  H -. aborted transaction .-> S[NOT_COMMITTED]
  H -. durable commit, UI ack lost .-> T[COMMITTED after restart]
